  "claim_boundary": "For the frozen local source asymptotic, the b-Mellin residue at z=-1 is lambda*R and has regulator weight one; its leading finite coefficient is zero and the full finite part is not forced by the first-order germ. Hence no preregistered local residue/finite coefficient/rate-independent combination with B supplies a direct all-36 fixed-target map. This does not exclude an equation-(66) global Mellin theorem, another source pairing, covariant target, nonlinear/higher-germ/non-Abel construction, AFK, fusion, Stark, or TCC.",
